A '''courtyard''' was used for the [[Rite of Ascension]] ceremony held by [[Mother (title)|Mother]] [[Aniseya]]'s [[Brendok coven|coven]] of [[witch]]es during the [[High Republic Era]].<ref name="Episode III" /> [[Sol]], a [[Jedi Master]], and  "[[the Stranger]]", a [[Sith Lord]], engaged in a [[lightsaber duel]] in the courtyard that resulted in Sol's [[death]] at the hands of [[Verosha Aniseya]].<ref name="The Acolyte">{{Acolyte|The Acolyte (episode)}}</ref>

